      "fieldData": {
       "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Link in Bio Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a link in bio landing page?\", \"a\": \"A link in bio landing page is a single page, built for a phone screen, that the link in a social profile points to. It holds the buttons, forms, and lists a follower might want next. One address then serves every post you publish.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I create a link in bio landing page?\", \"a\": \"Write a prompt for Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder'>AI landing page builder</a> that lists the buttons in the order you want them and any form the page should carry. Emergent builds the page from it. Publish it, paste the address into each profile's bio, and tap through it once on a phone.\"}, {\"q\": \"Which link should sit at the top of a link in bio landing page?\", \"a\": \"Put the one action you want this week at the top, such as a new product or an event signup. Below it, add answers to what followers keep asking in comments and messages: where to buy, when you are open, how to book. Leave off links to the profiles visitors already came from.\"}, {\"q\": \"When is a list of links the wrong choice for a bio landing page?\", \"a\": \"A list is the wrong choice when visitors come to make one decision about you. If people arrive to learn who you are and hire you, a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder/personal'>personal landing page</a> with one next step does that job better than six buttons. Keep the list for accounts that post about several things at once.\"}, {\"q\": \"How many buttons should a link in bio landing page have?\", \"a\": \"Start with four or fewer, and add one only when followers ask for something the page does not answer. Every button past the first competes with it for the same tap. Count taps per button for a month, then drop the one at the bottom.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can a link in bio landing page have an address under my name?\", \"a\": \"Yes. Custom domains are included in Emergent and use credits. Connect one, and the address in each bio sits under your own name. Pick something short enough to read off a video or say out loud, because some followers will type it in by hand.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can I show work samples on a link in bio landing page?\", \"a\": \"Yes, but keep them small: two or three thumbnails that each open the full piece. For a body of work a client will study, point one button to a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder/portfolio'>portfolio landing page</a> and let the bio page stay a quick router to everything else.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I see which buttons on a link in bio landing page get tapped?\", \"a\": \"Ask for it in the prompt: save each tap as a row with the button name and the time, and show a weekly count per button. The rows sit in a database you own. Sort them by button or by week to find the links that never get a tap.\"}, {\"q\": \"Does a link in bio landing page cost anything to publish?\", \"a\": \"It does not have to. Emergent is free to start, and the free tier covers building and publishing. Publish a first version with two buttons, then add more once you can see where the taps go.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should my link in bio landing page show during a launch?\", \"a\": \"Move the launch to the first button for as long as the launch runs, and point it to a page of its own. A <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder/product-launch'>product launch landing page</a> can carry the full pitch and the signup, while the bio page stays short. When the launch ends, move that button back down.\"}]}; </script></div></div>",
       "alpb---prompt": "<p>Build a link in bio landing page that saves every signup to a database I own.</p><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbPrompt = {\"default\": \"Build a link in bio landing page that saves every signup to a database I own.\", \"chips\": [{\"label\": \"Daily Stop Button\", \"add\": \"Add a daily stop button that shows the location from today's row in a table.\"}, {\"label\": \"Visits by Profile\", \"add\": \"Add visits by profile, saving each visit with the profile address it came from.\"}, {\"label\": \"Party Inquiries\", \"add\": \"Add party inquiries that email groups of 20 or more to the events manager.\"}, {\"label\": \"Adoptable Pets List\", \"add\": \"Add an adoptable pets list that drops a pet once staff mark it adopted.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
      }
     }
